e. In the midst of all of life's malarkey I am continuing to face emotional, medical, and financial trials, most recently involving my daughter and spouse being in a car accident. They were hit by a foreign driver while in their car, and while they are safe and well, it is all so tiresome. In addition to my ongoing medical struggles it is just a rough time, and it may seem silly, but the prayers of anonymous pedes worldwide has comforted me in the past, and I imagine it will continue to do so. \nMerci.", "author": "CovfefeBarista", "created": 1793077122644, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "11GenAm", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Pede Prayers Appreciated ", "last_comment_created": 1793081982536, "content": "<p>Nighttime gang rise up. I the CovfefeBarista humbly ask for your prayers once more. In the midst of all of life's malarkey I am continuing to face emotional, medical, and financial trials, most recently involving my daughter and spouse being in a car accident. They were hit by a foreign driver while in their car, and while they are safe and well, it is all so tiresome. In addition to my ongoing medical struggles it is just a rough time, and it may seem silly, but the prayers of anonymous pedes worldwide has comforted me in the past, and I imagine it will continue to do so.\nMerci.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 10, "score_up": 65, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2114900724702409119", "sticky_